```

5. Compile and link the project to create the Authentication Package DLL.

6. Register the DLL as a system DLL using the `Regsvr32` command:

```
Regsvr32.exe /s /n /i:MyCustomAuthPackage.dll
```

The custom Authentication Package will now be used for Windows authentication.

Prospective applications of a custom Authentication Package include:

