```

Now, create a new file called `index.html` and add the following code:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>WebRTC P2P Communication</title>
  <style>
    #localVideo, #remoteVideo {
      width: 300px;
      height: 200px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
